## How traffic works

Cloudflare (proxied) → CloudPanel **nginx** on the VPS → `127.0.0.1:3471` → Coolify container. Coolify does **not** own public 80/443 for `nurahelp.com` (same pattern as Receptly on this host).

## How deploy works

Push to `main` → [`.github/workflows/build-deploy.yml`](.github/workflows/build-deploy.yml) builds/pushes GHCR → `POST /api/v1/deploy` on Coolify (`dockerimage` pull only). **Do not** build Next on the VPS (OOM history).

GitHub secrets: `COOLIFY_TOKEN`, `COOLIFY_APP_UUID`, `COOLIFY_API_URL=https://server.nurahelp.com`.

## Hard rules

1. Dockerfile **`WORKDIR` must be `/nura`**, never `/app` (breaks `/` + CSS with `app/app` console routes).
2. **No secrets** in git, Mem0, or this rule (tokens, DB passwords, `AUTH_SECRET`).
3. After hosting changes: update `docs/production.md` + CHANGELOG + Mem0 (`user_id: emdr`).
